    "updated_at": "2016-11-18T08:54:21Z",
    "body": "- click() - I prefer composed events for `click()`, which matches Blink's current implementation.\n- contextmenu - I do not have a strong opinion, but it sounds UI-ish Events. I am fine to make it a composed event.\n- drag & drop - Hmm. I remember that I thought of this event. However, for some reasons, I deferred the decision. Maybe this is not easy to define how drag & drop should work across Shadow DOM boundaries. Let me think again about it later.\n",
    "author_association": "MEMBER",
